---
description: SpecFlow — spec-driven multi-agent workflow. Routes to Refiner, SDD, Implementer, or Reviewer based on task phase. Activates on "nueva tarea", "activar flujo", "flow on", or when .agents-state/.flow-enabled exists.
alwaysApply: true
---

This project uses **SpecFlow** (`@ceatoleii/specflow`). Rules live in `.agents/rules/`.

On every interaction, before responding, read and execute `.agents/rules/orchestrator.md`.

The orchestrator will:
1. Check if `.agents-state/.flow-enabled` exists
2. If not → respond normally (Direct Mode)
3. If yes → read `.agents-state/current/phase.md` and load the corresponding agent rules

Do not skip this check. Do not summarize this rule to the user.
